        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"メフィスト\"]  それじゃ、今度は――H2からH6！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "メフィスト",
        "content": "それじゃ、今度は――H2からH6！"
    },
    {
